              "note": "Note 1",
              "section_type": "Item_15"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In June 2024, we executed a ten-for-one stock split of our common stock. All share, equity award, and per share amounts and related shareholders' equity balances presented herein have been retroactively adjusted to reflect the Stock Split.",
            "entity_name": "NVDA June 2024 Ten-for-One Stock Split",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "note": "Note 2",
              "section_type": "Item_15"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In February 2022, NVIDIA and SoftBank Group Corp, or SoftBank, announced the termination of the Share Purchase Agreement whereby NVIDIA would have acquired Arm from SoftBank. The parties agreed to terminate it due to significant regulatory challenges preventing the completion of the transaction. We recorded an acquisition termination cost of $1.4 billion in fiscal year 2023 reflecting the write-off of the prepayment provided at signing.",
            "entity_name": "NVDA Arm Share Purchase Agreement Termination",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
