              "section_type": "Item_15"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In November 2023, the Financial Accounting Standards Board, or FASB, issued a new accounting standard requiring disclosures of significant expenses in operating segments. We adopted this standard in our fiscal year 2025 annual report.",
